WEBVTT

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:03.846
in which we can prevent
these potential consequences?

00:14:04.178 --> 00:14:07.759
And really, in my mind,
the simplest way to do that

00:14:07.783 --> 00:14:12.749
is to foster stronger cultures
of people who speak up

00:14:12.773 --> 00:14:15.209
and listening to those who speak up.

00:14:15.887 --> 00:14:18.574
So now the big question is,

00:14:18.598 --> 00:14:23.558
how do we make speaking up the norm
and not the exception?

00:14:23.582 --> 00:14:30.582
(Applause and cheers)